        "id": 1000039
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-02-22T00:22:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "how large is the buffer allocated by Ti50? Do DT SPI and I2C controllers supprot sending data longer than 2K?\n\nThis should be tested on DUTs with both kinds of TPM interfaces.",
      "parentUuid": "64181fb7_d55e8fdb",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 390,
        "startChar": 0,
